1
00:01:02,140 --> 00:01:05,980
=The Cruel Tribunal=
=Episode 13=

2
00:01:07,320 --> 00:01:07,800
You.

3
00:01:08,560 --> 00:01:08,920
Kneel.

4
00:01:09,840 --> 00:01:10,440
Why should we?

5
00:01:10,640 --> 00:01:12,280
We're the plaintiffs, sir!

6
00:01:12,680 --> 00:01:13,640
So what?

7
00:01:15,360 --> 00:01:16,080
Ma Shuan...

8
00:01:16,280 --> 00:01:17,680
He grabbed the knife to fight back.

9
00:01:18,280 --> 00:01:19,840
You shameless ruffians,

10
00:01:20,240 --> 00:01:21,240
twisting white into black

11
00:01:21,240 --> 00:01:22,360
and black into white.

12
00:01:23,240 --> 00:01:24,640
Do you take me for a lump of clay

13
00:01:25,040 --> 00:01:25,840
