14
00:01:26,920 --> 00:01:28,360
Forget whose knife it was.

15
00:01:28,460 --> 00:01:29,680
He did kill the man, didn't he?

16
00:01:30,040 --> 00:01:31,640
A life for a life. That's fair, right?

17
00:01:37,920 --> 00:01:38,360
By...

18
00:01:38,440 --> 00:01:39,320
By law,

19
00:01:39,320 --> 00:01:41,400
