20
00:01:42,020 --> 00:01:42,320
Then...

21
00:01:42,400 --> 00:01:43,240
What do I do now?

22
00:01:43,440 --> 00:01:44,760
What Ma Shuan did is self-defense.

23
00:01:44,840 --> 00:01:46,640
It's when a person or their property

24
00:01:46,640 --> 00:01:47,480
comes under unlawful attack,

25
00:01:47,480 --> 00:01:48,720
and they act to stop it.

26
00:01:48,840 --> 00:01:50,320
Any harm done to the attacker

27
00:01:50,320 --> 00:01:51,560
carries no criminal responsibility.

28
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:52,900
So that's how it works.

29
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:53,960
Got it.

30
00:01:57,320 --> 00:01:57,960
Ma Shuan,

31
00:01:58,080 --> 00:02:01,080
what he did today was self-defense.

32
00:02:01,640 --> 00:02:03,040
Self-defense means

33
00:02:03,120 --> 00:02:04,040
that Ma Shuan

34
00:02:04,240 --> 00:02:06,640
acted to protect himself or others,

35
00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:08,920
along with their property and rights,

36
00:02:08,920 --> 00:02:12,160
from an ongoing unlawful attack,

37
00:02:12,280 --> 00:02:13,960
and to stop it.

38
00:02:14,240 --> 00:02:14,760
As for

39
00:02:14,880 --> 00:02:17,320
any harm done to the attacker,

40
00:02:18,240 --> 00:02:19,720
he bears no criminal responsibility.

41
00:02:20,240 --> 00:02:20,640
Today,

42
00:02:21,120 --> 00:02:23,680
I will not only find Ma Shuan innocent,

43
00:02:23,840 --> 00:02:24,360
but

44
00:02:24,600 --> 00:02:25,840
I also want

45
00:02:25,840 --> 00:02:27,320
everyone under heaven,

46
00:02:27,440 --> 00:02:28,440
the weak,

47
00:02:28,600 --> 00:02:29,400
the desperate,

48
00:02:29,430 --> 00:02:30,280
every single person,

49
00:02:30,320 --> 00:02:32,280
when facing danger and a raised blade,

50
00:02:32,560 --> 00:02:35,240
to have the right to resist brutality.

51
00:02:36,560 --> 00:02:37,120
I

52
00:02:37,480 --> 00:02:38,720
want everyone

53
00:02:38,800 --> 00:02:41,080
