00:10:49,440 --> 00:10:50,960
a servant who was new to the palace

301
00:10:51,040 --> 00:10:52,680
fainted while fighting the fire.

302
00:10:52,680 --> 00:10:53,440
So I...

303
00:10:53,440 --> 00:10:53,920
I just...

304
00:10:53,920 --> 00:10:54,760
I swapped clothes with him

305
00:10:54,760 --> 00:10:56,520
and let him die in my place.

306
00:10:56,520 --> 00:10:59,240
I thought I'd gotten away with it, sir!

307
00:10:59,400 --> 00:11:00,600
Who was it back then

308
00:11:02,680 --> 00:11:04,320
that ordered you to poison her?

309
00:11:05,560 --> 00:11:06,360
Speak!

310
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:11,400
Who was it?

311
00:11:12,520 --> 00:11:12,960
Jing...

312
00:11:13,400 --> 00:11:14,760
Empress Jingshu.

313
00:11:19,670 --> 00:11:22,270
♪The candle burns down
to its final glow♪

314
00:11:23,230 --> 00:11:25,630
♪Cold fragrance clings to my hem♪

315
00:11:26,270 --> 00:11:28,030
♪You gently smooth my hair♪

316
00:11:28,030 --> 00:11:30,950
♪Yet your gaze drifts far away♪

317
00:11:33,390 --> 00:11:35,830
♪A hidden blade lies beneath your smile♪

318
00:11:36,190 --> 00:11:39,510
♪You turn away
as if nothing has changed♪

319
00:11:40,110 --> 00:11:41,670
♪Step by step, I walk away♪

320
00:11:41,830 --> 00:11:45,150
♪Each step breaks my heart anew♪

321
00:11:47,910 --> 00:11:50,790
♪If fate had not gone astray♪

322
00:11:51,310 --> 00:11:54,390
♪Why leave me standing
alone in the wind?♪

323
00:11:54,830 --> 00:11:57,430
♪We shared one fleeting life together♪

324
00:11:57,430 --> 00:12:01,470
♪Yet all that's left is warmth
upon my fingertips♪

325
00:12:01,710 --> 00:12:04,750
♪I'd melt this night into ink♪

326
00:12:05,150 --> 00:12:07,830
♪And write of every meeting
and every parting♪

327
00:12:07,830 --> 00:12:10,550
♪If next life asks
about the days gone by♪

328
00:12:10,830 --> 00:12:13,790
♪I'll only say that once♪

329
00:12:14,270 --> 00:12:16,030
♪I called your name♪

330
00:12:20,630 --> 00:12:22,870
♪The silent stars hang low♪

331
00:12:24,270 --> 00:12:26,470
♪The river keeps flowing east♪

332
00:12:27,710 --> 00:12:29,630
♪I linger in the old tower♪

333
00:12:29,750 --> 00:12:33,390
♪Waiting for you,
though all is now empty♪

334
00:12:34,710 --> 00:12:37,150
♪This life still owes us a bow♪

335
00:12:38,030 --> 00:12:40,830
♪May the next repay us with a dream♪

336
00:12:41,590 --> 00:12:43,830
♪Beyond here lie
endless mountains and rivers♪

337
00:12:43,830 --> 00:12:50,070
♪I dare not turn for one last look♪

338
00:12:50,350 --> 00:12:53,230
♪If fate had not gone astray♪

339
00:12:53,830 --> 00:12:57,310
♪Why bury this heart beneath the frost?♪

340
00:12:57,310 --> 00:12:59,950
♪We shared one fleeting life together♪

341
00:12:59,950 --> 00:13:04,230
♪Now only fading warmth
remains in my palm♪

342
00:13:04,230 --> 00:13:07,150
♪I'd melt this night into ink♪

343
00:13:07,590 --> 00:13:10,310
♪And paint a winter between your brows♪

344
00:13:10,310 --> 00:13:12,990
♪If we meet again in another life♪

345
00:13:13,310 --> 00:13:16,030
♪Will you believe that tonight♪

346
00:13:16,710 --> 00:13:18,990
♪Was when we first met?♪

347
00:13:20,270 --> 00:13:22,670
♪Will you believe that tonight♪

348
00:13:23,790 --> 00:13:25,550
♪Was when we met for the last time?♪
